  unitName: Gloomy
  unitId: 60030
  unitNumber: 53
  description: Glowy Slime's mutated form after being showered with magic. It has
    an extremely brutal nature and attacks humans it finds, all whilst constantly
    spitting out obscenities. However, since it is very weak like other slimes, it
    still is a good sparring partner for new Summoners. They've also been said to
    show kindness at times. Some think that it's actually just like Glowy Slime and
    that maybe it's just lonely.
  summonDesc: '*Growl* What''re you lookin'' at!?<br>Be your friend?<br>Of course
    I will! *Growl*'
  fusionDesc: Fusion? What the!?<br>*Growl* I don't wanna!
